 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uZVLmyKtH_8Q7kNvwGDKxUa&_nc_oc=Adob9g7KKCStt5H4riW8yQhDeuPMS5uM95w6KY4jHIV4P8DoZklbWcMdzePZYT0NUT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEQpO-NI60B-476uBxNj9zWijpyS_wXwpFCT2ASSYYJTA&oe=6A8591F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uPl83NGd3sQQ7kNvwFMM7cI&_nc_oc=AdqLjoEyliaEmN0yhbcrwhZcKk9QDJBfXhxTyyZVZuVYS4BxcV9ZUYQst3DxnUHM9pc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGtVCg7Ft8m07BhGg8FNwxR4xwXc6Dnq_ISBikKXrHlJQ&oe=6A859356"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kfTE151wAOEQ7kNvwHrbGFj&_nc_oc=AdoPMsx17phF9yvrjFGinNqh3J8aL_TJyAW3corBeFqtoSF_o02MGfgoK01xtvlFGEA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHBq1FI1rJyGqtcgrPo0UqZ-u6oPOpyFExf2pHJPZ-GVg&oe=6A85A877"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri":